capability number/round-decimals  a float rounded at a given decimal place
  heroes  numbers.round_to
  go      -
  rust    -
  python  round(x, ndigits), float.__round__, int.__round__
  note    Python's `round(x, n)`, half to even on the exact value, so 2.675 at 2 is 2.67; past the largest float it is `inf`, where Python raises `OverflowError`; `math` refers this to `numbers`; 488 values against Python, 0 disagreeing

